Type Conversion

Convert one data type into another.

age = "21"

print(type(age))

Convert to integer.

age = int(age)

print(type(age))

Examples

print(int(3.9))

Output

3
print(float(10))

Output

10.0
print(str(100))

Output

"100"
print(bool(1))

Output

True
print(bool(0))

Output

False
